# Allowlist, not a denylist: this directory is mostly runtime state that Claude
# Code recreates and rewrites on its own (session transcripts, caches, history,
# synced skills). New state dirs appear without warning, and some hold client
# work, so nothing is tracked unless it is named here.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!rules/
!rules/*.md
!README.md
!settings.json
!statusline/
!statusline/render.sh
